@startuml sequence-overview
!include theme.iuml
title Trilium ETAPI MCP — overview

skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

actor "MCP client\n(Claude Code, …)" as Client
participant "trilium-mcp\n(this repo)" as Sidecar #98D486
participant "Trilium\nETAPI" as Trilium

== ETAPI token (headless clients, trusted LAN) ==
Client -> Sidecar : MCP tool call over HTTP\nAuthorization: <ETAPI token>
Sidecar -> Trilium : same token forwarded to /etapi
Trilium --> Sidecar : notes data
Sidecar --> Client : MCP tool result

== OAuth (remote access, app clients) ==
Client -> Sidecar : first connect: browser login\nwith the Trilium password
Sidecar -> Trilium : /auth/login → ETAPI token\nminted for this client
Sidecar --> Client : OAuth access + refresh token
Client -> Sidecar : MCP tool call over HTTP\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>
Sidecar -> Trilium : mapped ETAPI token forwarded to /etapi
Trilium --> Sidecar : notes data
Sidecar --> Client : MCP tool result

note over Sidecar : Turns each ETAPI endpoint into an MCP tool.\nToken mode holds no secret; OAuth stores the\nminted ETAPI tokens encrypted.

@enduml
